    "1.20.1-5.0.12": "- [Make the patchouli provider actually work correctly when extending foreign books.](https://github.com/ModdingX/LibX/commit/b0278b36317f59b7aa2ceedb4774d559f827eacf) - *noeppi_noeppi*",
