    "1.21.1-6.0.4": "Merge branch 'fix/hand-command' into 1.21 - noeppi_noeppi\nPrint a warning if a config validator is registered from an unexpected mod. - noeppi_noeppi\nMake the data component toPrettyComponent work with different data component type registries again. - noeppi_noeppi\nFix error in encoding data components in hand command - MelanX",
